    {
      "cn_text": "植物具有某种程度意识的观点最早于2000年代初萌生；「植物神经生物学」一词正是围绕植物行为的某些方面可与动物智能相比拟这一概念而提出的。",
      "en_text": "The idea that plants have some degree of consciousness first took root in the early 2000s; the term “plant neurobiology” was coined around the notion that some aspects of plant behavior could be compared to intelligence in animals.",
