    {
      "cn_text": "作者指出，植物生物学虽复杂而迷人,但与动物生物学差异极大，以至于所谓植物智能的证据尚不足以定论。",
      "en_text": "Plant biology is complex and fascinating, but it differs so greatly from that of animals that so-called evidence of plants’ intelligence is inconclusive, the authors wrote.",
