    {
      "cn_text": "然而，泰兹指出，植物中的信号传导仅在表面上类似于复杂动物大脑中的放电活动，而后者远非「一团通过电流交流的细胞」那么简单。",
      "en_text": "However, the signaling in a plant is only superficially similar to the firing in a complex animal brain, which is more than “a mass of cells that communicate by electricity,” Taiz said.",
      "id": 2022013007,
      "order_seq": "content_4_2",
      "task_id": 202201001,
      "tokens": [
        {
